2026-07-27T16:20:45.7023719Z i /tmp/RtmpLouusr/duckdb
2026-07-27T16:20:45.7024168Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T16:20:45.7024655Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T16:20:45.7025084Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T16:20:45.7025525Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T16:20:45.7026154Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T16:20:45.7026969Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
